\f3\fs26 \cb3 \{score, reason\}
\f1\fs24 \cb1  (machine-readable + auditable 
\f3\fs26 \cb3 reason
\f1\fs24 \cb1 ).\
\ls5\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 temperature 0
\f1\b0  \'97 deterministic scoring.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Judge 
\f0\b biases to defend against
\f1\b0 :\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls6\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Position bias
\f1\b0  (favors A or B by order) \uc0\u8594  randomize order in pairwise.\
\ls6\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Verbosity bias
\f1\b0  (longer looks better) \uc0\u8594  rubric says judge content, not length.\
\ls6\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Self-preference
